        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2794,
        "name": "日落莓莓茶",
        "desc": "<p>酸甜怡人的果饮。醇正的茶底，融合了果物的芳香。清凉的口感伴随着咕咚咕咚的声响，能驱散所有的燥闷烦热。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/08/88072335/81a485da670a4b785b911a14bea59dea_8418652356471321848.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2793,
        "name": "奇怪的日落莓莓茶",
        "desc": "<p>酸甜怡人的果饮。为了压住酸涩的味道，不小心加入了过量的糖。本想着喝一杯解解渴，没想到越喝越渴，还是再加点水吧。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/08/88072335/c655888e4e16cc4791646ba7acf5c0c3_5612646040744773340.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2792,
        "name": "美味的日落莓莓茶",
        "desc": "<p>酸甜怡人的果饮。绵长空幽的茶香带着思绪走远，仿佛置身于枝叶繁茂的果园之中，一阵风拂过，送来甘甜沁爽的果香，引人沉醉。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/08/88072335/e73488521c11ce95efc0f73ed66ab2a0_5182112203325735978.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "九果甘露饮"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7806,
        "name": "食谱：九果甘露饮",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「九果甘露饮」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2024/09/27/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_7668299764384701555.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2797,
        "name": "墩墩桃",
        "desc": "<p>林中灌木结出的果实。肉质敦实，味道香甜可口。据说食用后还有宁心安神的功效。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2022/09/18/47826599/cc66085ba88fdb28bb907431cbb55cef_5034711764633517371.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 883,
        "name": "日落果",
        "desc": "遍布提瓦特大陆的自然恩惠，如夕阳般靓丽美好的饱满果实。有着奇异的香甜气味，能让人精神百倍。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sunsettia_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1503,
        "name": "苹果",
        "desc": "爽脆可口的酸甜果实，无论生食或是酿酒都很是美味。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Apple_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 960,
        "name": "树莓",
        "desc": "颜色鲜艳的果实。遍布野外的小小美好，能将路途疲惫一扫而空。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Berry_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7818,
        "name": "九果甘露饮",
        "desc": "多种果汁混合而成的饮料。按照特定比例将各类果汁均匀混合，使得众多水果风味互相交织，保持了酸酸甜甜的好味道，加入冰块更显美味。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/16/8c93c3c9493b579e24edd73b5edb5aea_2386706363287281045.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7817,
        "name": "奇怪的九果甘露饮",
        "desc": "多种果汁混合而成的饮料。又酸又苦…怎么甚至还带点咸？唯独少了期待中的甜味，这复杂的味道…难道制作过程中不小心混入了未知的草药汤？",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/16/cb3d73d9f2fde1383fee759ff5ecc486_321002714058705651.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 7819,
        "name": "美味的九果甘露饮",
        "desc": "多种果汁混合而成的饮料。一口入喉，仿佛身体被阳光下的水果篮稳稳接住，自然清甜的香气在鼻尖飘过，每一口都是缤纷果香的完美融合。热浪来袭时喝上一杯，说是灵魂的救赎也不为过！",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2025/06/16/b36e79e281c916a59db1e22906afd8a1_7918070375813084496.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "琼玉果汤"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3753,
        "name": "食谱：琼玉果汤",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「琼玉果汤」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/16/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_3416668109969069572.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 883,
        "name": "日落果",
        "desc": "遍布提瓦特大陆的自然恩惠，如夕阳般靓丽美好的饱满果实。有着奇异的香甜气味，能让人精神百倍。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sunsettia_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1328,
        "name": "糖",
        "desc": "提炼自甜甜花的调味剂。它的甜味仿佛有着与人共鸣的力量，能够驱散内心的阴霾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sugar_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1048,
        "name": "清心",
        "desc": "只生长在孤高石峰的通透白花。不愿接受平原的温暖与湿润，宁可在清冷的尖峰眺望远方。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Qingxin_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1184,
        "name": "琉璃袋",
        "desc": "拥有旺盛生命力的小花，传说朝下盛开的花姿是为了守住它的香气。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Violetgrass_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3781,
        "name": "琼玉果汤",
        "desc": "<p>传统的璃月甜品。将水烧开后加入各种食材，慢炖一段时间，再加入冰糖，小火熬至汤汁微稠清亮。长时间的炖煮造就了柔软的口感，轻抿即化，老少咸宜。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/16/88072335/8610e70a7ff611670a812db135717be2_2180762985829061645.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3779,
        "name": "奇怪的琼玉果汤",
        "desc": "<p>传统的璃月甜点。草率地将食材全部倒入锅中，导致成品尝起来更像是史莱姆原浆···呃，虽然口感有点影响食欲，但用料本身对健康还是有益的吧？</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/16/88072335/2babfc2d18833099c1bece87e83cf647_4646553539342363885.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3782,
        "name": "美味的琼玉果汤",
        "desc": "<p>传统的璃月甜品。大片的果块浸于澄莹汤水之中，宛若一叶舟行于汩汩流淌的一湾溪水之上，舌尖的花果香气便是那一缕袭人的清风。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/16/88072335/1ec7c472fc5e5fc86f8f2b92854b0622_8119881601576010129.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3809,
        "name": "清热降火汤",
        "desc": "<p>白术的特色料理。「这算不上是药，只是略有去燥之效罢了。」随着白术关切的声音在耳边响起，一碗晶莹澄澈的果汤映入眼帘。「以前是不加糖的，但这家伙怕你吃不得苦，特意加了少许糖。」长生又补上了一句。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/05/31/88072335/2a81265255a0de3899ca4dfd73e7e040_7497653545097732202.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "Heading",
        "level": 3,
        "text": "假日果酿"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关食谱"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2865,
        "name": "食谱：假日果酿",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「假日果酿」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/02/26/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_2262019021681791708.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
