        "epId": 3688,
        "name": "食谱：薄荷曼果茶",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「薄荷曼果茶」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/09/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_4151130799110607168.png",
