      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1547,
        "name": "薄荷",
        "desc": "饱含清凉成分的植物叶子。清爽冰凉的滋味能将暑气荡涤一空。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Mint_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 883,
        "name": "日落果",
        "desc": "遍布提瓦特大陆的自然恩惠，如夕阳般靓丽美好的饱满果实。有着奇异的香甜气味，能让人精神百倍。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sunsettia_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 960,
        "name": "树莓",
        "desc": "颜色鲜艳的果实。遍布野外的小小美好，能将路途疲惫一扫而空。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Berry_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1328,
        "name": "糖",
        "desc": "提炼自甜甜花的调味剂。它的甜味仿佛有着与人共鸣的力量，能够驱散内心的阴霾。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Sugar_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3689,
        "name": "薄荷曼果茶",
        "desc": "<p>清新爽口的饮品。沁脾的茶香与酸甜的果味相融合，一瞬间便激活了味蕾，不消半会儿，便已喝光一大杯。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/09/88072335/97261c62713d079faab32c7b22f7403c_7879219327737534739.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3690,
        "name": "奇怪的薄荷曼果茶",
        "desc": "<p>清新爽口的饮品。喝下第一口，牙齿便被酸得仿佛要离家出走。设想中的清甜回甘被涩味所取代，这真的是果茶吗？</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/09/88072335/78fd1b9f5df140ba9ba7c8cf859ddd44_1880758548072988154.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 3691,
        "name": "美味的薄荷曼果茶",
        "desc": "<p>清新爽口的饮品。甘醇茶味融合清冽的花香，同时又与沁甜的果香交缠，一口入喉，芬芳满心。哎呀，怎么杯底只剩冰块了？</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/04/09/88072335/5651947da411c5828b5d8ddddedc2da5_8403367905843728356.png",
